[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3389215253","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111428#issuecomment-3389215253","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111428","id":3389215253,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KA1IV","user":{"login":"bleeqer","id":59035549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDM1NTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59035549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bleeqer","html_url":"https://github.com/bleeqer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bleeqer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bleeqer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bleeqer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bleeqer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bleeqer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bleeqer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bleeqer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bleeqer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bleeqer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-10T10:16:15Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T10:16:15Z","body":"I was able to reproduce this and looked into the rendering code. It seems the Canvas background mode for camera environments doesn’t actually render any canvas layers.  it only performs a framebuffer copy. This behavior doesn't seem to be a simple bug but a limitation of the current RenderingDevice pipeline. A proper fix would require integrating the canvas renderer as a compositor pass, which is beyond a small patch. I’ll skip this one for now, sorry that i couldn't help you","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3389215253/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart